---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Button, Card, StudySessionHero } from '@acepharm/ui';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="AcePharm — Pharmacy revision that shows you exactly what to study next."
  description="AcePharm brings pharmacy-specific questions, clear explanations and progress analytics into one focused platform designed for UK pharmacy students."
>
  {/* 2.2 Hero Section */}
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-wash/60 via-canvas to-canvas border-b border-border">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="inline-block mb-4">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-wash text-indigo text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border border-indigo-200">
          Created by pharmacists. Built for pharmacy students.
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight">
        Pharmacy revision that shows you exactly what to study next.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        AcePharm brings pharmacy-specific questions, clear explanations and progress analytics into one focused platform designed for UK pharmacy students.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2">
        <a href="https://app.acepharmexams.co.uk/auth/register">
          <Button size="lg" variant="primary">Start revising free</Button>
        </a>
        <a href="/features">
          <Button size="lg" variant="outline">Explore the platform</Button>
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-light">
        No card required. Upgrade only when you are ready.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider">
        Built for MPharm students and the next generation of pharmacists.
      </p>

      {/* Hero Visual Live Preview Card */}
      <div class="mt-12">
        <StudySessionHero 
          client:visible
          recommendationTopic="Respiratory medicines"
          questionCount={15}
          weakestTopic="Asthma and COPD"
          strongestTopic="Calculations"
          dailyGoalAnswered={12}
          dailyGoalTarget={20}
          currentStreakDays={4}
          resumeUrl="https://app.acepharm.co.uk/auth/register"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.3 Trust Strip */}
  <section class="py-10 bg-canvas border-b border-border">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-light mb-6">
        Trusted revision. Evidence-led learning.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center text-xs text-slate font-medium">
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">Every answer referenced to UK clinical guidance</div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">Triple review workflow: clinical, educational, editorial</div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">Isolated first-attempt vs practice calibration data</div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">Built exclusively for UK pharmacy practice</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.4 Problem Section */}
  <section class="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Revision should not feel like guesswork.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate leading-relaxed">
        Pharmacy students often have plenty of material but no clear way to decide what deserves attention. Notes become scattered, question banks show percentages without explaining what to do next, and revision plans quickly fall behind.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-indigo">
        AcePharm brings the important parts together, so every session has a purpose.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <Card className="p-6 bg-surface border border-border rounded-card shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Scattered resources</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Switching between BNF tabs, lecture slides and disjointed practice PDFs makes revision fragmented and exhausting.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card className="p-6 bg-surface border border-border rounded-card shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Unclear progress metrics</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
          A generic percentage score doesn't tell you whether you truly understand a topic or simply memorised the answer on a repeat attempt.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card className="p-6 bg-surface border border-border rounded-card shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Overwhelming scope</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Without adaptive guidance, students spend precious revision hours on comfortable topics instead of clinical blind spots.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.5 Learning Loop */}
  <section class="py-20 bg-canvas border-y border-border">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo">More than a question bank</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink mt-2">A complete learning loop.</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">Every answer should help make the next study decision easier.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-wash text-indigo font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">1</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-2">Focused Practice</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">Answer realistic single best answer and pharmacy calculation scenarios with pre-submission confidence ratings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-wash text-indigo font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">2</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-2">Deep Explanations</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">Learn from structured 4-stage breakdowns: takeaway point, full clinical rationale, option-by-option analysis, and guidance links.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-wash text-indigo font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">3</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-2">Calibration Insights</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">Track first-attempt accuracy separately from repeat practice and uncover high-confidence blind spots.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-wash text-indigo font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">4</span>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-2">Targeted Next Step</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate leading-relaxed">Receive an adaptive recommendation for your next session based on unseen volume and weak subtopics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.6 Question Experience */}
  <section class="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Questions designed to teach, not merely test.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate leading-relaxed">
        Work through focused practice or timed sessions. Rate your confidence before submitting, compare your reasoning with the explanation, and revisit difficult questions when you need to.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
        {['Single best answer', 'Pharmacy calculations', 'Timed or untimed', 'Confidence rating', 'Bookmark and notes', 'Question flagging', 'Keyboard shortcuts', 'Detailed answer review', 'Referenced learning points'].map((feat) => (
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface border border-border rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate shadow-xs">{feat}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://app.acepharmexams.co.uk/auth/register">
          <Button variant="primary">Try a sample question</Button>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.9b Ace AI Section */}
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-wash/40 via-canvas to-canvas border-y border-border">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo">Meet Ace</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink mt-2">A tutor that has read every explanation, and remembers every answer you gave.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Ace sits beside every question. Ask it to explain something differently, challenge the answer, or test you on it — and it answers from AcePharm’s reviewed content, citing where each point came from.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/ace"><Button variant="primary">See Ace on a real question</Button></a>
          <a href="/ace"><Button variant="outline">How Ace works</Button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.12 Pricing Teaser */}
  <section class="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink">Premium revision without premium-student pricing.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate">
        Start with the free question sampler. Upgrade when you are ready for full access.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      {/* Monthly */}
      <Card className="p-8 bg-surface border border-border rounded-card shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Monthly Access</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">£4.99</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate">per month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Flexible access for focused periods of revision.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/pricing">
            <Button variant="outline" className="w-full">Choose monthly</Button>
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>

      {/* Yearly */}
      <Card className="p-8 bg-surface border-2 border-indigo rounded-card shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 right-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo text-white text-[11px] font-bold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm">
            Most popular · Save £9.89
          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Yearly Revision</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">£49.99</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate">per year</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-teal font-semibold mt-1">Equivalent to £4.16/month (billed annually).</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            One payment for a full year of uninterrupted revision.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/pricing">
            <Button variant="primary" className="w-full">Choose yearly</Button>
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-xs text-slate-light mt-8">
      Clear renewal information. Cancel online. Your completed progress remains available if your subscription ends.
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* 2.13 FAQ Preview */}
  <section class="py-16 bg-canvas border-t border-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-5 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Is AcePharm only for the Registration Assessment?</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-2 leading-relaxed">No. AcePharm is being designed to support students throughout the MPharm degree and into foundation training. Available content is clearly labelled by pathway and stage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Who writes the questions?</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-2 leading-relaxed">Questions are written and reviewed through AcePharm’s editorial process. Each published item has an identifiable authoring and review history.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-surface rounded-card border border-border shadow-xs">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">Are the answers referenced?</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate mt-2 leading-relaxed">Key learning points link to appropriate guidance, formularies, primary sources or other approved references. Review dates are shown where relevant.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-8">
        <a href="/faq"><Button variant="outline" size="sm">View all frequently asked questions</Button></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2.14 Final CTA */}
  <section class="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Your next revision session is already waiting.</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-slate max-w-xl mx-auto mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Create your free account, choose your learning goal and begin with a focused set of pharmacy questions.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="https://app.acepharmexams.co.uk/auth/register"><Button size="lg" variant="primary">Start revising free</Button></a>
      <a href="/pricing"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">View pricing</Button></a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-light mt-3">No card required for free access.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
